 "title": "Perfect complex over the coefficient ring on $X$",
 "statement": "In the Poincare duality conventions of this chapter (the fixed setting),\n$K\\in D^b_{ctf}(X,\\Lambda)$. Then $K$ is *perfect over\n$\\Lambda_X$* if it is quasi-isomorphic, locally on the\nsmall pro-etale site of $X$,\nto a bounded complex of finite projective $\\Lambda_X$-modules.",
